#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about the authorization roles and permissions available for the IBM Quantum REST APIs."
msgstr "IBM Quantum REST API에 사용 가능한 authorization 역할과 권한에 대해 알아보세요."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles"
msgstr "Authorization 역할"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authorization roles {#authorization-roles}"
msgstr "Authorization 역할 {#authorization-roles}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review the available roles and the actions mapped to each to help you assign access. See [IAM roles and actions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155) on IBM Cloud&reg; for more information.\n"
msgstr "액세스를 할당하는 데 도움이 되도록 사용 가능한 역할과 각 역할에 매핑된 작업을 검토하세요. 자세한 내용은 IBM Cloud&reg;의 [IAM 역할 및 작업](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/iam?topic=iam-iam-service-roles-actions#service-roles-table155)을 참조하세요.\n"

